{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497450/extras/5f081c076fef97fe0274ade04ab8854d.avif?t=1765452884\" width=630 height=630 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497450/extras/d1808e4459a4b767ada385ca4cbf0b69.avif?t=1765452884\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>Tap and match or merge on the multi-hued cubes and create amazing color combinations to reach the next gorgeous level awaiting to be solved. <br>Enjoy a huge variety of puzzle modes and challenges, all with simple tap controls. Travel the map full of exciting matching puzzles levels and enjoy colorful and cute Fuzzies' adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497450/extras/506e4681f49636509262ed0de2cea17e.avif?t=1765452884\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>Simple, but fun and challenging tile matching game-play will keep you entertained for hours and hours. There\u2019s always something new to discover in Fuzzy Flip. After all every Fuzzy\u2019s motto is, \u201cThe more, the merrier!\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497450/extras/da2dcf4cf2486234edcb4528a5b4ef31.avif?t=1765452884\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MATCHING and MERGING TILES: If you enjoy Match-3 games, puzzles, brain-teasers and adventure, then hurry up and join Fuzzies on their quest! <br></li><li>MULTIPLE LEVELS: Over 150 fun-packed brain-teasers provide many hours of puzzle-packed challenge and enjoyment. Exciting discovery every step of the way!<br></li><li>BUILD SUPER COMBO\u2019S: Use strategy to combine Fuzzies and build super combinations to receive amazing results and rewards!<br></li><li>BEAUTIFUL STYLE: Gorgeous, colorful puzzle levels within this magical Fuzzy fairy-tale.<br></li><li>BOOST YOUR FUZZY-POWER: Use powerful spells to boost your results when needed!<br></li><li>IMPROVE YOUR BRAIN: Sharpen your cognitive skills and have fun doing it!<br></li><li>NO PRESSURE, TAKE YOUR TIME: There\u2019s no time limit. Take as many goes and as much time as you want to complete each fun-packed challenge!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fuzzy Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/f4c2bbc40de795f7806bbdb56d2060c909938cc4.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/8e2716dc38b79dbf217a8bc9d5fe2d7cf00641f1.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Native","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/4763f6241973e77d948eb95ee2f8ad01e3950d0b.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/0116301ad698f20cc6be9e82c8a61fedcb7059ba.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/464fe16a8cfee352f041fcdf7f3de3e4060324c1.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/dc47b44da5c741860c9f8e0518ee4a5f357660c7.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Starter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/eec70e5e00d41574ff0b51014a886de2b01414b1.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/3c025d797649dd990d5e344bd79dad54396be9ae.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/8090fbfb2715a4152fff5590a3a9cbc44b6655a4.jpg"},{"name":"Fuzzy Sheriff","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497450/12e4c8ff3bf5627976508d1e2fc1ac4cdc59e89f.jpg"}],"t